text Break time. Finally.
sound 03P.aac
text @[Boy]
text A ghost?
text Two students sitting in front of me are engrossed in absurd gossip, reference books still in hand.
sound 03Q.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Yeah, it sounds like people have been seeing a lot of them lately. Especially a female student's ghost.
sound 03R.aac
text @[Boy B]
text Seriously...?
text It's a stupid conversation, but whether or not I want to hear it, I do.
sound 03S.aac
text @[Boy A]
text There's this guy who knows that student, and according to him, it's definitely a ghost.
sound 03T.aac
text @[Boy B]
text I can't believe it...
sound 03U.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Yeah... because you see, that girl...
sound 03V.aac
text @[Boy A]
text ...was in a traffic accident two years ago.
sound 03W.aac
text @[Boy A]
text They say she was hospitalized for a while, but in the end, they couldn't save her...
sound 03X.aac
text @[Boy A]
text She got in the accident right after starting high school...
sound 03Y.aac
text @[Boy A]
text So she still felt an attachment to this place since she wasn't able to have a full high school experience...
sound 03Z.aac
text @[Boy A]
text And that's apparently why she became a ghost that comes here for fun...
sound 040.aac
text @[Boy A]
text It's kind of a sad story.
sound 041.aac
text @[Boy B]
text But you know...
sound 042.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Hm?
sound 043.aac
text @[Boy B]
text The guy who told you that is another third-year, right?
sound 044.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Yeah.
sound 045.aac
text @[Boy B]
text You know what that means, right?
sound 046.aac
text @[Boy A]
text What?
sound 047.aac
text @[Boy B]
text He's trying to distract us from studying.
sound 048.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Wha...?
sound 049.aac
text @[Boy B]
text In other words... he's trying to cut down on the number of potential rivals.
sound 04A.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Well... I guess that could be true too.
sound 04B.aac
text @[Boy B]
text You shouldn't be so quick to believe him, is what I'm trying to say.
sound 04C.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Maybe you're right...
sound 04D.aac
text @[Boy A]
text But the rumor just feels kinda true, you know?
sound 04E.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Maybe a TV crew is going to come and make it a huge story.
sound 04F.aac
text @[Boy B]
text Yeah, right.
text What would Sunohara have done if he had heard this story?
text He'd probably be excitedly tugging on my arm right about now, saying that we should go check it out ─ a child-like glow captured in his fascinated, manic eyes.
text I look at the empty seat next to me.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Good thing he's not here...)
text Of course there's no such thing as ghosts.
